window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Penelope Hansen has had to share from the moment she was conceived. First the womb, then her parents' attention, and so on—you get the picture.</b></p> <p>During challenging moments in her life, she used to daydream about her mate, the male who would belong to her alone, the one who would take her away from a pack and a life in which she's always felt second-best.</p> <p>But then her mate turns out to be the silent, widowed, emotionally unavailable Alpha Dominic.</p> <p>Will this be the mating Penelope has always dreamed of? Or will Dominic's unresolved issues with the past break her heart?</p>"; 
